<import src="../../templates/rows.wxml"/><view class="app theme-{{theme}}"><view class="wrap"><view class="intro"><view class="h1">米其林全球名录</view><view class="sub">在地图上找附近的店，也能把筛选结果发给朋友。</view></view><view class="controls"><scroll-view scroll-x class="levels"><view class="row nowrap"><view wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{level===(index===0?'all':index-1+'')?'selected':''}}" data-value="{{index===0?'all':index-1+''}}" bindtap="selectLevel">{{item}}</view></view></scroll-view></view><view class="scope">附近的餐厅<text class="count">{{items.length}} 家</text></view><view class="location-panel" wx:if="{{!located}}"><view class="h2">从身边的一餐开始</view><view class="sub">允许定位后，按距离查看附近的米其林餐厅。</view><view class="btn primary" bindtap="locate">{{loading?'正在定位…':'定位到我'}}</view></view><view wx:else class="maptools"><text>按距离由近到远</text><text class="linkbtn" bindtap="locate">重新定位</text></view><template is="rows" data="{{groups}}"/></view></view>